        "passages": [
          {
            "id": "s1:p1",
            "text": "Sphagneticola is a genus of flowering plants in the family Asteraceae. Creeping-oxeye is a common name for plants in this genus."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p2",
            "text": " Species\n Sphagneticola brachycarpa (Baker) Pruski - Guyana, Venezuela, Brazil, Paraguay, Argentina, Peru, Bolivia\n Sphagneticola calendulacea (L.) Pruski - China, Japan, India, Sri Lanka, Indochina, Indonesia, Philippines\n Sphagneticola gracilis (Rich.) Pruski - Puerto Rico, Cuba, Hispaniola, Jamaica, Antigua\n Sphagneticola trilobata (L.) Pruski - native to South America, widely naturalized in many subtropical and tropical regions (Asia, Australia, Pacific Islands, Mesoamerica, West Indies, Florida, Louisiana etc.)\n Sphagneticola ulei O.Hoffm. - native to the American tropics"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "title": "Sphagneticola",
        "language": "pt",
        "scope": "verified_requested_taxon",
        "passages": [
          {
            "id": "s2:p1",
            "text": "{{Info/Taxonomia\n |nome =Sphagneticola\n |imagem = Starr 020127-0034 Sphagneticola trilobata.jpg\n |reino = [[Plantae]]\n |clado1 = [[Angiosperma|angiospérmicas]]\n |clado2 = [[Eudicotiledôneas|eudicotiledóneas]]\n |ordem = [[Asterales]]\n |família = [[Asteraceae]]\n |género = '''''Sphagneticola'''''\n |subdivisão_nome = Espécies\n |subdivisão = \n<center>\n}}"
          },
          {
            "id": "s2:p2",
            "text": "Sphagneticola é um género botânico pertencente à família Asteraceae."
          },
          {
            "id": "s2:p3",
            "text": "Espécies\nO gênero Sphagneticola possui 5 espécies reconhecidas atualmente.\n Sphagneticola brachycarpa (Baker) Pruski\n Sphagneticola calendulacea (L.) Pruski\n Sphagneticola gracilis (Rich.) Pruski\n Sphagneticola trilobata (L.) Pruski\n Sphagneticola ulei O.Hoffm."
          },
          {
